        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Used to make Pokéblocks that will enhance your\nCleverness. Its green flesh is bitter when eaten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "かしこさに　磨きを　かける　ための\nポロックを　つくるとき　使われる。\n緑色の実は　食べると　苦い。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用于制作宝可方块，\n制作出来的宝可方块可用来打磨聪明。\n绿色的果实尝起来是苦的。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Se utiliza en la producción de Pokécubos que potencian\nel ingenio. Es de color verde y sabor amargo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
